  "body": "Adaptive clearing on the rotary developed wrap (#9, round 2).\n\n**What changed**\n- The rotary wrap ladder no longer pins Adaptive to Offset rings; each developed level runs the HSM planner, and every developed arc is chorded before wrapping (radial poses, no arc survives the wrap).\n- Seam law (`hsm::Seam`): a level whose centre component reaches a cover end short of a full lap is refused for Adaptive by name.\n- Any planner refusal on the wrap names \"the developed level at radius R\"; Offset rings cut that level. Offset rings are byte-identical to main (digest pinned).\n\n**Readings** (release; r6 wall / r5 neck in r7 stock, BN D6, leave 0.5, stepdown 0.5, Helix r1; load law 19.7 % D)\n\n| Radius | Moves | Peak load | Breaks > 5 deg |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 6.5 | 22,528 | 19.5 % D | 0 |\n| 6.0 | 22,528 | 19.5 % D | 0 |\n| 5.5 | 7,416 | 18.8 % D | 0 |\n| 5.0 | refused (planning budget), rings | - | - |\n\n**Pinned by** `rotary_adaptive::adaptive_plans_the_developed_levels_under_the_load_and_kink_laws`, `rotary_adaptive::the_developed_window_reaches_the_planner_and_names_each_refusal` (heavy lane), `rotary_adaptive::offset_rings_on_the_wrap_are_the_program_they_always_were`, `machining3d::hsm::tests::the_seam_cuts_an_area_at_a_cover_end_short_of_a_lap`.\n\n**Gates**: quick gate green (motion suites); the agent ran app rotary_verify/rotary_fixtures/golden_cl/operations, release `--ignored` rotary_adaptive, clippy `-D warnings` - all green.\n\n**Follow-ups**: #54, #55.\n\nChangelog: feat(motion): Adaptive clears the rotary developed wrap level by level under the load and kink laws; refused levels named by radius, cut by Offset rings\n\nFixes #9\n",
